    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a disturbed spirit and your task is to find the culprit for desecrating your home. Defeat everyone who gets in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190810/extras/7c99f0f42d472d3261dbc80878f99e61.poster.avif?t=1738506671\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190810/extras/7c99f0f42d472d3261dbc80878f99e61.webm?t=1738506671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190810/extras/7c99f0f42d472d3261dbc80878f99e61.mp4?t=1738506671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the objects around you to fight against opponents who outnumber you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The one-hit-one-death combat mechanics make combat dynamic and intense. Use your superior mobility (and frequent checkpoints).</p>",
